title: "Materials Knowledge in Large Language Models: Learning, Expression, and Reliability"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation and fine-tuning code for a study of how large language models
  represent and express materials knowledge across bandgap prediction,
  dielectric constant prediction, crystal system classification and
  knowledge-graph completion.
